flowchart TD
  subgraph once [Once at startup]
    A[Create Window / GLFW context] --> B[GL.createCapabilities]
    B --> C[Allocate Framebuffer color and depth]
    C --> D[Create a GL texture for the blit]
  end

  subgraph frame [Each frame]
    E[pollEvents] --> F[Clear CPU color and depth]
    F --> G[Three vertices in screen space]
    G --> H[Bounding box of the triangle]
    H --> I{Pixel inside triangle?}
    I -->|no| J[Next pixel]
    I -->|yes| K{Depth test pass?}
    K -->|no| J
    K -->|yes| L[Write color and depth]
    L --> J
    J --> I
    I -->|box done| M[Upload color to GL texture]
    M --> N[Draw a fullscreen quad]
    N --> O[glfwSwapBuffers]
  end

  D --> E
  O --> P{shouldClose?}
  P -->|no| E
  P -->|yes| Q[Destroy window]
